// AurOS: AurOS's own fixes install by themselves, the same way and at
// the same time as Ubuntu's security updates (20auto-upgrades,
// 51auros-unattended). The origin is AurOS's own signed repository
// (sources.list.d/auros.sources, Signed-By pinned to AurOS's key);
// preferences.d/auros limits it to AurOS's packages.
// docs/security/UPDATES.md
Unattended-Upgrade::Origins-Pattern {
        "origin=AurOS,label=AurOS,archive=stable";
};
